        </h2>

        <!-- Paragraph -->
        <p class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-gray-600 text-lg mb-12 max-[768px]:!mb-[25px]">
            We provide personalized medical support, expert guidance, and a wide range of
            healthcare services to help you stay healthy, recover faster, and live better.
        </p>

    <div class="treatments-section">
        <div class="mx-auto">
            
            <!-- Treatments Grid -->
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-12 max-[768px]:!mb-[25px]">
                                    <!-- Wrap the entire card content in a clickable <a> tag -->
                    <a href="/ayurvedic-treatments/skin-diseases/" class="[transition:all_0.4s_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1)] hover:-translate-y-2 bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl border border-slate-100 cursor-pointer block">
                        <!-- Title -->
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 hover:text-[#0595C4] transition-colors duration-300 text-left">
                            Ayurvedic Skin Treatment at Praanavaidya                        </h3>
                        
                        <!-- Description -->
                        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed text-left">
                            Skin diseases are commonly caused by weak digestion, toxin accumulation, blood impurities, inflammation, hormonal imbalance, stress, and dietary errors.                        </p>
                    </a>
                                    <!-- Wrap the entire card content in a clickable <a> tag -->
                    <a href="/ayurvedic-treatments/joint-and-back-pain/" class="[transition:all_0.4s_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1)] hover:-translate-y-2 bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl border border-slate-100 cursor-pointer block">
                        <!-- Title -->
                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 hover:text-[#0595C4] transition-colors duration-300 text-left">
                            Ayurvedic Treatment for Joint &amp; Back Pain                        </h3>
                        
                        <!-- Description -->
                        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed text-left">
                            Joint and back pain, including knee pain, neck stiffness, frozen shoulder, and sciatica, can return even after temporary relief, often due to underlying causes like inflammation, posture issues, and lifestyle imbalances.                        </p>
