                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 hover:text-[#0595C4] transition-colors duration-300 text-left">
                            Ayurvedic Treatment for PCOD &amp; PCOS                        </h3>
                        
                        <!-- Description -->
                        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed text-left">
                            Irregular periods, unexplained weight gain, hormonal acne, hair fall, excess facial hair, and fertility-related concerns are among the most common signs of PCOD and PCOS. These conditions affect millions of women in India, and many remain unaddressed for years despite causing significant physical and emotional distress.                        </p>
                    </a>
                                    <!-- Wrap the entire card content in a clickable <a> tag -->
                    <a href="/ayurvedic-treatments/asthma/" class="[transition:all_0.4s_cubic-bezier(0.4,0,0.2,1)] hover:-translate-y-2 bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-lg hover:shadow-2xl border border-slate-100 cursor-pointer block">
