                        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 hover:text-[#0595C4] transition-colors duration-300 text-left">
                            Asthma Treatment In Ayurveda                        </h3>
                        
                        <!-- Description -->
                        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed text-left">
                            Repeated wheezing, chest tightness, breathlessness, night cough, and sudden flare-ups occur because treatment often focuses only on symptom control and not on the underlying imbalance. Weak digestion, excess Kapha, airway sensitivity, allergies, pollution exposure, stress, and low immunity together trigger recurring asthma episodes.                        </p>
                    </a>
                                    <!-- Wrap the entire card content in a clickable <a> tag -->
